      "id": "wl_001",
      "weekOf": "2026-04-20",
      "title": "On patience",
      "body": "Dear Wander,\n\nPatience isn't waiting passively. It's trusting that the right moment will arrive — and being ready when it does.\n\nThis week, try noticing where you rush. Not to stop rushing, but just to see it. That noticing is the first act of patience.\n\nWith warmth."
